# Mansion World
# Rooms and entities for the mansion Discord server

# ============================================================================
# Zone record type
# ============================================================================
%rec: Zone
%key: Id
%mandatory: Id Name
%allowed: Id Name Description

Id: floor-1
Name: Floor 1
Description: The ground floor of the mansion

# ============================================================================
# Room record type
# ============================================================================
%rec: Room
%key: Id
%type: Zone rec Zone
%type: HasVoice bool
%type: IsDefault bool
%mandatory: Id Name Description Zone
%allowed: Id Name Description Zone HasVoice IsDefault

Id: foyer
Name: Foyer
Zone: floor-1
IsDefault: yes
Description: You are standing in a grand entryway
+
+ ahead of you is a closed off staircase, the 2nd floor is off limits
+ to your west is a #sitting-room
+ to your north-west is the #gallery
+ to your east is a #hallway

Id: sitting-room
Name: Sitting Room
Zone: floor-1
Description: A cozy sitting room.
+
+ to your east is the #foyer

Id: hallway
Name: Hallway
Zone: floor-1
Description: A hallway, if this was a counterstrike make people would call this connector
+
+ to your north is the #banquet-hall
+ to your east is the #office
+ to your west is the #foyer

Id: office
Name: Office
Zone: floor-1
HasVoice: yes
Description: An office with a bunch of computer equipment. Lots of paperwork related to working on https://github.com/frizzle-chan/mudd
+
+ Northern door leads to the #lounge
+ Western door exits back out to the #hallway

Id: gallery
Name: Gallery
Zone: floor-1
Description: A long room, walls laden with gilt-framed canvases. Impressive art collection!
+
+ to the west is the #library
+ to the east is the #foyer

Id: library
Name: Library
Zone: floor-1
Description: You are standing in the library.
+
+ In the northern corner of the room is the entrance to the #screening-room
+ behind you is the #gallery

Id: screening-room
Name: Screening Room
Zone: floor-1
HasVoice: yes
Description: The room is dark, the lit only by the projector screen cast on the western wall. You can make out theater seats resembling giant lay-z-boy chairs. The room smells like popcorn. This is a certified kinography lair. Only the finest kinos are screened in this room.
+
+ The only door leads back to the #library

Id: banquet-hall
Name: Banquet Hall
Zone: floor-1
Description: You are standing in a vast tiled banquet hall with several round tableclothed tables each flanked with many chairs. Although the austere appearance reminds you of a wedding reception, you get the sense that pizza night is the most frequent event held here.
+
+ to the east is the #lounge
+ the entrance to the #kitchen is in the far north east corner
+ to the south is the #hallway

Id: kitchen
Name: Kitchen
Zone: floor-1
Description: An industrial looking kitchen. Reminds you of that TV show The Bear. That show was alright I guess.
+
+ On the east side of the room you see a walk-in #freezer and a door to the #store-room
+
+ to the west is the #banquet-hall

Id: freezer
Name: Freezer
Zone: floor-1
Description: You walk into the freezer and shut the door. Wow it's cold in here, I don't know what I expected.
+
+ The #kitchen is on the other side of the freezer door.

Id: store-room
Name: Store Room
Zone: floor-1
Description: A store room with a bunch of dry goods as well as random stuff like extra chairs, trash bags, etc.
+
+ door exits back out to the #kitchen

Id: lounge
Name: Lounge
Zone: floor-1
HasVoice: yes
Description: A dimly lit lounge.
+
+ There is a door on the south side of the room leading to the #office
+ To the west is the #banquet-hall

# ============================================================================
# Entity record type
# ============================================================================
%rec: Entity
%key: Id
%type: Prototype rec Entity
%type: Container rec Entity
%type: Room rec Room
%type: ContentsVisible bool
%type: SpawnMode enum none move clone
%type: FocusMode enum none container
%type: Rarity enum none common uncommon rare epic legendary mythic quest
%mandatory: Id Name
%allowed: Id Name Prototype Container Room ContentsVisible SpawnMode FocusMode DescriptionShort DescriptionLong
%allowed: OnLook OnTouch OnAttack OnUse OnTake OnOpen OnClose OnDrop
%allowed: Tags Rarity

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base prototypes (no Room field - these are templates, not instances)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: object
Name: object
Rarity: none
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }}.
OnLook: {{ e.description_long or e.description_short or "You see nothing special." }}{{ contents }}
OnTouch: You touch the {{ name }}. Nothing happens.
OnAttack: You attack the {{ name }}, but it has no effect.
OnUse: You can't use the {{ name }}.
OnTake: You can't take the {{ name }}.

Id: furniture
Name: furniture
Prototype: object
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} sits here{% if contents %}. On it:{{ contents }}{% endif %}

Id: chest
Name: chest
Prototype: object
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} sits here.
FocusMode: container
OnLook: {{ e.description_long or e.description_short or "You see nothing special." }}
OnUse: You open the {{ name }}.{% if contents %} Inside:{{ contents }}{% else %} It's empty.{% endif %}
OnOpen: You open the {{ name }}.{% if contents %} Inside:{{ contents }}{% else %} It's empty.{% endif %}
OnClose: You close the {{ name }}.

Id: glass_object
Name: Glass Object
Prototype: object
OnAttack: You suppress the intrusive thought to smash the {{ name }}

Id: record
Name: record
Prototype: object
OnUse: You pull {{ name }} from its sleeve, place it on the turntable, and drop the needle. Music fills the room.
OnTake: You can't take the {{ name }}, but you can __play__ it.

Id: item
Name: item
Prototype: object
Rarity: common
SpawnMode: move
OnTake: You pick up the {{ name }}.
OnDrop: {% if container %}You put the {{ name }} into the *{{ container.name }}*.{% else %}You drop the {{ name }}.{% endif %}{{ effects.drop() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user.name ~ " drops " ~ e.display_name ~ ".") }}

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Foyer entities
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: foyer_table
Name: Wooden Table
Prototype: furniture
Room: foyer
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} sits in the middle of the room{% if contents %}. On it:{{ contents }}{% endif %}
DescriptionLong: A sturdy oak table with worn edges.
ContentsVisible: yes

Id: foyer_flower_vase
Name: Flower Vase
Prototype: glass_object
Room: foyer
Container: foyer_table
DescriptionShort: A teal {{ name }} with yellow roses in it
DescriptionLong: a teal ceramic vase with gold trim around the lip. A couple yellow roses sit inside.

Id: foyer_plaque
Name: Inscribed Plaque
Prototype: object
Room: foyer
Container: foyer_table
DescriptionShort: An {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: A wooden plaque with a shiny brass plate. The inscription reads: "Welcome to my mansion! You can usually find us in the office down the hall. -Frizzle"

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gallery entities
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: gallery_map
Name: Mansion Map
Prototype: object
Room: gallery
DescriptionShort: A rough {{ name }} hangs on the wall.
DescriptionLong: A hand-drawn map of the mansion in a simple wooden frame. The sketchy lines show the layout of the ground floor with annotations:
+ • Library: west from here
+ • Screening Room: through the library, in the northern corner
+ • Office: east to foyer, east to hallway, then east again
+ • Banquet Hall: east to foyer, east to hallway, then north

Id: gallery_portrait
Name: Portrait of Two Dogs
Prototype: object
Room: gallery
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} hangs prominently on the wall.
DescriptionLong: A formal oil portrait in an ornate gilded frame. Two goldendoodles pose regally against a deep burgundy backdrop. The smaller one on the left has fluffy apricot fur and bright curious eyes - her brass nametag reads "Lulu". The larger one on the right has a dignified bearing with wavy golden fur - her nametag reads "Ruby". They look like very good girls.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lounge entities
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: lounge_globe_minibar
Name: Globe Minibar
Prototype: furniture
Room: lounge
DescriptionShort: An oversized {{ name }} sits in the corner.
DescriptionLong: A vintage wooden globe on a brass stand. The northern hemisphere swings open to reveal a minibar stocked with bottles.
ContentsVisible: yes
OnUse: You swing open the globe and pour yourself a drink. It restores health.

Id: lounge_fridge
Name: Drink Fridge
Prototype: furniture
Room: lounge
DescriptionShort: A windowed {{ name }} sits against the east wall.
DescriptionLong: A glass-door mini fridge humming quietly. Through the window you can see it's full of White Claw and Lone Star tallboys.
ContentsVisible: yes
OnTouch: The glass is cold and slightly damp with condensation.
OnUse: You take a drink from the fridge and crack it open. It restores health.
OnTake: You take a drink from the fridge and crack it open. It restores health.

Id: lounge_chairs
Name: Comfy Chairs
Prototype: furniture
Room: lounge
DescriptionShort: Several {{ name }} are scattered around the room.
DescriptionLong: Plush leather armchairs that look like they've hosted many late-night conversations.
OnUse: You sink into one of the leather chairs and close your eyes for a moment. You feel your health regenerating.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Library entities
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: library_couches
Name: Long Couches
Prototype: furniture
Room: library
DescriptionShort: A pair of {{ name }} surround a coffee table in the center.
DescriptionLong: Overstuffed leather couches arranged in a U-shape, perfect for reading or napping.
OnUse: You stretch out on one of the couches. The leather is soft and worn in all the right places. You feel your health regenerating.

Id: library_coffee_table
Name: Coffee Table
Prototype: furniture
Room: library
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} sits between the couches{% if contents %}. On it:{{ contents }}{% endif %}
DescriptionLong: A low wooden coffee table with some ring stains from forgotten drinks.
ContentsVisible: yes

Id: library_bookshelves
Name: Bookshelves
Prototype: furniture
Room: library
DescriptionShort: Tall {{ name }} cover three walls.
DescriptionLong: Floor-to-ceiling bookshelves stuffed with books that look brand new, as if the owner read the first chapter and then never picked them up again. Some shelves are reserved for movies, others for showing off trinkets.

Id: library_desk
Name: Writing Desk
Prototype: furniture
Room: library
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} sits in the southern half of the room{% if contents %}. On it:{{ contents }}{% endif %}
DescriptionLong: An antique writing desk with a worn leather top.
ContentsVisible: yes

Id: library_record_player
Name: Record Player
Prototype: object
Room: library
Container: library_desk
DescriptionShort: An Audio Technica {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: An Audio Technica AT-LP60XBT turntable. Not the fanciest record player by any means, but gets the job done. There is a record ready to play.
OnUse: You press the play button and the automatic mechanism spins the record and drops the needle. Music fills the room. You like this song!

Id: library_records
Name: Wooden Chest
Prototype: chest
Room: library
ContentsVisible: no
DescriptionShort: A {{ name }} sits on the floor next to the desk.
DescriptionLong: A large wooden chest, it's not locked so you can __open__ it.

Id: record_machine_girl
Name: Machine Girl - WLFGRL
Prototype: record
Room: library
Container: library_records
DescriptionShort: A vinyl copy of {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: 2014. Chaotic internet-era experimental electronic.
OnUse: You unsleeve {{ name }} and place it on the turntable.{{ effects.broadcast(user.mention ~ " put " ~ name ~ " on the record player. [MG1](https://youtu.be/oWzzNvcxY4w) fills the room.") }}

