# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sitting Room entities
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: sitting_room_chairs
Name: Comfy Chairs
Prototype: furniture
Room: sitting-room
DescriptionShort: Several {{ name }} are arranged around the room.
DescriptionLong: Plush armchairs upholstered in faded floral fabric. They look well-loved.
OnUse: You settle into one of the armchairs near the fire. The warmth and comfort wash over you. You feel your health regenerating.

Id: sitting_room_fireplace
Name: Fireplace
Prototype: object
Room: sitting-room
DescriptionShort: A cozy {{ name }} crackles on the wall.
DescriptionLong: A stone fireplace with a carved wooden mantle. A small fire crackles warmly.
OnTouch: The warmth feels nice on your hands.
OnAttack: You poke at the fire with the stoker. The logs shift and sparks fly up the chimney.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Store Room entities (test fixtures)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: storeroom_box
Name: Cardboard Box
Prototype: chest
Room: store-room
ContentsVisible: no
DescriptionShort: a beat-up {{ name }} sits in the corner
DescriptionLong: A cardboard box with "TEST FIXTURES - DO NOT REMOVE" written on it in marker.
OnOpen: You open the {{ name }}.{% if contents %} Inside:{{ contents }}{% else %} It's empty.{% endif %}
OnClose: You close the {{ name }}.

Id: storeroom_crate
Name: Wooden Crate
Prototype: chest
Room: store-room
ContentsVisible: no
DescriptionShort: a sturdy {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: A wooden crate, slightly worn from use.
OnOpen: You pry open the *{{ name }}*.{% if contents %} Inside:{{ contents }}{% else %} It's empty.{% endif %}
OnClose: You close the *{{ name }}*.

Id: test_orb
Name: Test Orb
Prototype: object
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
DescriptionShort: a glowing {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: TEST_LOOK_RESPONSE - A mysterious orb used for testing.
OnTouch: TEST_TOUCH_RESPONSE - The orb hums softly.
OnAttack: TEST_ATTACK_RESPONSE - The orb absorbs the blow.

Id: test_gadget
Name: Test Gadget
Prototype: object
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
DescriptionShort: a strange {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: A device with many buttons.
OnUse: TEST_USE_RESPONSE - The gadget whirs to life.
OnTake: TEST_TAKE_RESPONSE - You pick up the gadget.

Id: test_lockbox
Name: Test Lockbox
Prototype: chest
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
DescriptionShort: a small {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: A metal lockbox.
OnOpen: TEST_OPEN_RESPONSE - You open the lockbox.
OnClose: TEST_CLOSE_RESPONSE - You close the lockbox.

Id: test_record
Name: Test Record
Prototype: record
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
DescriptionShort: a {{ name }} for testing
DescriptionLong: A test record.
OnUse: TEST_EPHEMERAL_RESPONSE{{ effects.broadcast("TEST_BROADCAST_RESPONSE " ~ user.mention) }}

Id: test_takeable
Name: Test Takeable
Prototype: item
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
SpawnMode: move
Rarity: common
DescriptionShort: a {{ name }} you can pick up
DescriptionLong: A test item that can be picked up.
OnTake: TEST_TAKE_MOVE_RESPONSE - You pick up the {{ name }}.

Id: test_quest_map
Name: Test Quest Map
Prototype: object
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
SpawnMode: clone
Rarity: quest
DescriptionShort: a {{ name }} for your quest
DescriptionLong: A test quest item that can be cloned.
OnTake: TEST_TAKE_CLONE_RESPONSE - You copy the {{ name }}.

Id: test_droppable
Name: Test Droppable
Prototype: item
Room: store-room
Container: storeroom_box
SpawnMode: move
Rarity: common
DescriptionShort: a {{ name }} you can drop
DescriptionLong: A test item that can be dropped.
